OL,3,ATrump arrives to greet Xi in rare
OL,4,Aairport welcome to kick off three-day
OL,5,AUS visit
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS President Donald Trump will soon
OL,8,Fgreet Xi Jinping in a rare airport
OL,9,Fwelcome as the Chinese leader's plane
OL,10,Ftouches down ahead of a three-day visit
OL,11,Fto the US
OL,13,FTariffs, AI, the Iran war and Taiwan
OL,14,Fare among the key issues the pair could
OL,15,Fdiscuss this week, but what does each
OL,16,Fside want?
OL,18,FAdding to the high-stakes state visit,
OL,19,Fa US-China trade agreement reached last
OL,20,Fyear is set to expire in November
